      "cwe_id": [22],
      "note": "Same constraints as the OPDS variant: find_accessible_book! scopes the lookup to the user's accessible libraries (404 otherwise), Book#absolute_path joins library.path with the scanner-supplied file_path, the controller verifies the resolved path stays under the owning library root before send_file, and the filename is sanitized via Books::FileFormat.download_filename. The endpoint serves the EPUB / CBZ / PDF bytes to the in-app reader (Cookie auth)."
